1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,254
Bebek.

2
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:01,805
Bebek?

3
00:00:02,175 --> 00:00:02,812
Berapa ekor?

4
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:04,294
Tiga ribu.

5
00:00:04,352 --> 00:00:05,906
Bebek dari tiga kabupaten.

6
00:00:05,969 --> 00:00:08,683
Kak, jendelanya digigit.

7
00:00:08,761 --> 00:00:10,363
Bebek tiga kabupaten,

8
00:00:10,434 --> 00:00:11,260
peraknya kurang separuh.

9
00:00:12,189 --> 00:00:13,390
Pakai nama Toko Xu,

10
00:00:13,793 --> 00:00:14,508
Utang.

11
00:00:14,765 --> 00:00:16,006
Nama baik keluarga,

12
00:00:16,330 --> 00:00:17,414
demi penilaianku?

13
00:00:17,690 --> 00:00:17,993
Ya.

14
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:19,578
Hitunganmu tak pernah meleset.

15
00:00:20,223 --> 00:00:23,742
Tang Xiaotang, poin suka empat puluh lima.

16
00:00:25,786 --> 00:00:27,161
Atas nama Toko Xu,

17
00:00:27,241 --> 00:00:28,645
lunas saat panen.

18
00:00:31,154 --> 00:00:33,605
Kak, bebek naik kamu!

19
00:00:33,785 --> 00:00:34,814
Bebeknya bandel,

20
00:00:34,978 --> 00:00:36,448
belalang lewat bukit!

21
00:00:38,854 --> 00:00:39,251
A-Ling?

22
00:00:43,254 --> 00:00:44,759
Kok… dia bisa?

23
00:00:45,235 --> 00:00:45,792
Nggak tanya.

24
00:00:45,860 --> 00:00:47,601
Bisa, itu cukup.

25
00:00:56,032 --> 00:00:58,823
Bebek… basmi belalang?

26
00:00:58,899 --> 00:01:00,663
Lucu sekali.

27
00:01:02,295 --> 00:01:04,608
Satu, dua, tiga…

28
00:01:04,683 --> 00:01:06,343
Banyak bebeknya!

29
00:01:08,915 --> 00:01:10,760
Wabah belalang dihentikan,

30
00:01:10,837 --> 00:01:13,309
sawah Liuxi selamat.

31
00:01:13,380 --> 00:01:14,645
Cukup, kembali.

32
00:01:14,884 --> 00:01:15,778
Orang desa sebelah,

33
00:01:15,851 --> 00:01:17,283
menyembahmu.

34
00:01:17,348 --> 00:01:19,239
Rebut hati negeri:

35
00:01:19,312 --> 00:01:20,831
dua persen.

36
00:01:20,896 --> 00:01:22,468
Bukan cuma mereka…

37
00:01:22,552 --> 00:01:23,515
Hati rakyat?

38
00:01:26,610 --> 00:01:27,253
Tutup gerbang!

39
00:01:27,888 --> 00:01:29,196
Beras kurang!

40
00:01:29,629 --> 00:01:30,415
Beras cuma cukup

41
00:01:30,480 --> 00:01:31,450
dua bulan.

42
00:01:31,524 --> 00:01:32,134
Kau putuskan.

43
00:01:34,724 --> 00:01:35,857
Beras kurang,

44
00:01:35,919 --> 00:01:38,515
sekampung kelaparan!
